<mxfile host="drawio" agent="vscode-drawio">
  <diagram id="architecture" name="1. Architecture">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1700" dy="1170" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1700" pageHeight="1170" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />

        <!-- Title -->
        <mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;Onward Logistics&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Secure Network for the Order System&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#545B64&quot;&gt;Solution architecture (Week 2)&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="20" width="270" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Outside AWS -->
        <mxCell id="merchants" value="&lt;b&gt;Merchants and&lt;br&gt;customers&lt;/b&gt;" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#232F3D;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=top;verticalAlign=bottom;align=center;html=1;fontSize=12;aspect=fixed;pointerEvents=1;shape=mxgraph.aws4.users;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="195" width="78" height="78" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="engineers" value="&lt;b&gt;Engineers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;(own IAM user)" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#232F3D;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=top;verticalAlign=bottom;align=center;html=1;fontSize=12;aspect=fixed;pointerEvents=1;shape=mxgraph.aws4.users;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="925" width="78" height="78" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="github" value="&lt;b&gt;GitHub repository&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;week-2-secure-network/&lt;br&gt;deployment.yaml + templates/" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#24292F;fontSize=11;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="1050" width="220" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Legend -->
        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Flows&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#147EBA&quot;&gt;1  Inbound:&lt;/b&gt; internet gateway, then the load balancer (HTTP 80), then a healthy web server in either zone, then the order servers (8080).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#D86613&quot;&gt;2  Updates:&lt;/b&gt; private servers go out through the NAT gateway in their own zone. Nothing on the internet can start a connection in.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#248814&quot;&gt;3  Admin:&lt;/b&gt; engineers open a Session Manager session. The SSM Agent on each server calls out on 443 (3b). No port 22, no keys.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#545B64&quot;&gt;4  Deploy:&lt;/b&gt; merge to main, GitSync, CloudFormation builds everything." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#545B64;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;arcSize=3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="320" width="270" height="300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rules" value="&lt;b&gt;Route tables&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Public: 0.0.0.0/0 to internet gateway&lt;br&gt;Private A: 0.0.0.0/0 to NAT gateway A&lt;br&gt;Private B: 0.0.0.0/0 to NAT gateway B&lt;br&gt;Private A and B: S3 to gateway endpoint&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Security groups&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;alb-sg: 80 from the internet&lt;br&gt;web-sg: 80 from alb-sg only&lt;br&gt;order-sg: 8080 from web-sg only&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;No group allows port 22.&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#545B64;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;arcSize=3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="640" width="270" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

